---
name: deep-research
description: Research a topic thoroughly in an isolated context, without polluting the main conversation with every file it reads
argument-hint: "[topic]"
context: fork
agent: Explore
allowed-tools: Read Grep Glob
---

Research $ARGUMENTS thoroughly:

1. Find relevant files using Glob and Grep.
2. Read and analyze what you find.
3. Summarize findings with specific file references.

Report only the summary - the coordinator that invoked you never sees which
files you opened along the way, only this final report.
